    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6781" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-κοπή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>resistance, check</i> due to
			collision, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.7U.
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.14
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.76f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1128c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>recoil</i> of the waves, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.21.6
			</span></i>; in a tidal river, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.5.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>back-water,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>clashing</i> of vowels in hiatus, etc., <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dem.</u>
				38
			</span></i>.</div>
